Date: Thu, 20 Aug 2026 17:32:16 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] qtimlqnn: Add support for loading model graph from DLC

Extend the model file support to accept Deep Learning Container ('.dlc')
files besides the model libraries ('.so') and cached context binaries
('.bin'). The DLC is loaded through the QNN system library which is
already used by the plugin, so no new dependency is needed.

Replace the 'iscached' flag with a GstMLQnnModelType enum and share the
graph info translation between the context binary and DLC paths.

Assisted-by: Qgenie
Change-Id: I059114dd7e3990621623423fd612c750f950faa2
Signed-off-by: Tushar Darote <tdarote@qti.qualcomm.com>
